  "notes": [
    "Image bytes were never touched: every index digest is identical before and after, so no workload rolled.",
    "build-scan, aggregate and open-image-bump-pr all skipped in 0s - a backfill cannot promote.",
    "techx.sourceSha carries the commit each image was actually built from, recovered from the promotion commits (bump images from <sha>), so a running pod traces back to a real commit as Directive #10 requires.",
    "Verification used cosign v2.6.2. Cosign v3 resolves the OCI 1.1 referrers left by the pre-#490 pipeline and reports the CycloneDX attestation as missing; get-sbom.sh now refuses a mismatched major version instead of surfacing that as a false negative.",
    "grafana is included even though its reference renders as techx-corp:<tag>@sha256:<digest>. The subchart hardcodes that form, so the policy glob will be widened rather than the chart repinned - which also avoids recreating the Grafana pod and disturbing the PM-176 baked-plugin fix."
  ],
